+ *   - consume — atomic debit; rejected when the requested amount would
+ *               exceed the cap (`over_limit`) or when the tenant is
+ *               unknown (`unknown_tenant`).
+ *   - reset   — UPSERT a tenant's cap and zero its `used` counter;
